            <div class="post">
                <div class="posthead">
                    <h2><a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/07/07/did-you-know-screenshots-of-virtual-pc-instances.aspx">Did you know?  Screenshots of Virtual PC Instances</a></h2>
                    Posted 
                    <a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/07/07/did-you-know-screenshots-of-virtual-pc-instances.aspx">Monday, July 07, 2008 3:31 PM</a>                
